   "text": "\n\n\nRestaurants\n\nHotels\n\nThings to do\n\nTransit\n\nParking\n\nPharmacies\n\nATMs\n\n\n\nSaved\n\nRecents\nGuntersville Dam Ranger Office\n\nGet app\n\nSee photos\nGuntersville Dam Ranger Office\n4.9\n(18)\nGovernment·\nOverview\nReviews\nAbout\n\nDirections\n\nSave\n\nNearby\n\nSend to phone\n\nShare\n\n1698 Snow Point Rd, Guntersville, AL 35976\n\n\nCJC3+XV Guntersville, Alabama\n\n\n\nSuggest an edit\nAdd missing information\n\n\nAdd place's phone number\n\nAdd hours\n\nAdd website\nPhotos\n\n29 Photos\n\nAdd photos & videos\nReview summary\n\n5\n4\n3\n2\n1\n4.9\n18 reviews\n\"Nice place to sit and watch the water flow by, or have a picnic.\"\n\"Lots of fishing and fish being caught.\"\n\"Restrooms available, pretty nice place.\"\n\nWrite a review\nReviews\n\n\nSort\n\nAll\npicnic\n2\nrestrooms\n2\nfishing\n3\nBrian Bolding\nLocal Guide · 22 reviews · 11 photos\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4 years ago\nMy favorite place in the entire world, so peaceful!\n+7\n\n2\n\nShare\nJeff Clark\nLocal Guide · 534 reviews · 148 photos\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2 years ago\nNice place to sit and watch the water flow by, or have a picnic. Restrooms on site. Fishing can be really good at times. Bird watching can be incredible as well. Just a decent all around place to visit.\n\nLike\n\nShare\nJose Pablo Esquivel\nLocal Guide · 26 reviews\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2 years ago\nRestrooms available, pretty nice place. Can get crowded at times, also, if you need ice, tackle or snacks, their's a store 3 miles before the dam.\n\nLike\n\nShare\nMore reviews (15)\nAbout this data\n\nYou're seeing a limited view of Google Maps. See more\n\nSign in\n\n\n\n\n Layers\nImagery ©2026 Airbus, Maxar Technologies, Map data ©2026 United States3D Earth view is not availableTermsPrivacySend Product Feedback\n200 ft",
